   "dot": "cyan",
   "title": "Keys",
   "items": [
    "Four child tables hang off entry and cascade on delete",
    "entry is unique on (category, pf, state); state is merging or installed",
    "Paths and file data are BLOB; world and world_sets keep file order in pos"
